<div style="text-align: center;">
<p><em>&quot;Tired of your home? Sick of comfort? Come to the Hole in the Vacant Lot out back of the Ralph’s and huddle with Us.</em></p>
<p><em>Who are we? Good question.</em></p>
<p><em>Come to the Hole in the Vacant Lot out back of the Ralph’s and huddle with Us.</em></p>
<p><em>Why do we want you to come? Why did we spend money for this airtime? We understand you are confused.</em></p>
<p><em>But: Hole, Vacant Lot, Ralph’s, huddle, Us.</em></p>
<p><em>For the low-low price. Act today. Or tomorrow. Not Wednesday. Wednesday is no good for Us.</em></p>
<p><em>Anyway, we’re almost out of airtime, so just come on down to the Hole in the Vacant Lot out back of the Ralph’s and huddle with Us.</em></p>
<p><em>Or else.&quot;</em></p>
<p><em>~ Welcome to Night Vale, Episode Five.</em></p>
</div>
<p>So, yeah, just some creepypasta monsters. T'is the season, and I'm hoping I managed to make them interesting enough to earn a few upvotes.</p>
<p>Thanks to my beta readers: CaptainKirby, ChrisPratten,Darkstuff, Drblackbox, IHP, stormbreath, superblooby, thebillith, and Weryllium.</p>

